er."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"SOPIIDamage","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"RO635","expression":6,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"It's also possible that the Commander didn't receive it at all. I'm not exactly holding onto hope on a battlefield like this. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"So, how do you want to tell everyone about this? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"If we lie to our friends, and tell them the Commander's reinforcements are coming right away, it could make them fight harder, you know?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"SOPIIDamage","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"RO635","expression":6,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4 SOPMOD II","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I don't know...you're the smart one. Tell me what to do..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"SOPIIDamage","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"RO635","expression":6,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I'm sorry, but thinking with this body is too much of a pain. I'm going to sleep."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"SOPIIDamage","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"RO635","expression":6,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4 SOPMOD II","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Hey, come on! Cx4's coming in soon, help me out here!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"SOPIIDamage","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"RO635","expression":6,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Eh...even losing doesn't feel like a big deal... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"If I have to be lugged around inside this body, I might as well die..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"SOPIIDamage","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tag